_refine_special_details
;
The cubic cell was obtained by indexing the principal reflections as
111, 200, 220, 311, 222, 400, 331, 420, 422 and 511/333.
Atomic coordinates correspond to the ideal ordered MgAgAs-type
half-Heusler model. Atomic displacement parameters were not determined
from the supplied pattern.
;

